{
  "$comment": [
    "SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for app/service identity and wiring.",
    "",
    "Adding an app to this monorepo used to mean touching eight unrelated files, with",
    "nothing cross-validating them; five of them had quietly drifted apart by",
    "2026-08-17 (see docs/todo/erp2-program/01-registry-drift-report.md). Every one of",
    "those surfaces is now checked against this file by scripts/js/verify-app-wiring.js,",
    "which fails the build on any disagreement.",
    "",
    "WHAT LIVES HERE: identity and wiring — key, systemd unit, workspace directory,",
    "npm package name, env prefix, URL var, port, api-pro domains, launcher category,",
    "and the flags that record a DELIBERATE divergence so it can never be mistaken",
    "for drift again.",
    "",
    "WHAT DOES NOT: presentation (label, icon, description). Those stay in",
    "packages/shared/lib/roles.js APP_META until the admin console’s app-catalogue",
    "work (docs/todo/admin-console-program/01-app-catalogue-entitlements.md) moves the",
    "catalogue server-side per tenant. Baking titles in here now would be work undone",
    "the moment a tenant can enable its own app set.",
    "",
    "NOTHING IS DERIVED ANY MORE. Until the P3 restructure (2026-08-18) the validator",
    "computed envPrefix and urlVar from the workspace directory name — pos-auth ->",
    "AUTH__PORT. That rule died with the move: the workspace is now a path, and",
    "\"APPS/ADMIN/AUTH__PORT\" is not an environment variable. Both are stored",
    "explicitly, which is also what lets an app be renamed without its deploy env",
    "changing underneath it.",
    "",
    "FLAGS (absent = the common case):",
    "  public        no access grant needed; always in the catalogue, never in VALID_APP_KEYS",
    "  npmWorkspace  false = installs standalone via `npm --prefix` (the two backends)",
    "  build         false = has no build step, so no root build:* script is expected",
    "  launcher      false = not a launchable app, so no roles.js APP_URLS entry",
    "  descriptorScan false = excluded from APP_FOLDERS in discover-descriptor-meta.mjs"
  ],

  "categories": ["sales","inventory","people","finance","content","admin"],

  "services": [
    {
      "key": "strapi",
      "unit": "rutba_strapi",
      "workspace": "services/strapi",
      "npm": "@rutba/strapi",
      "kind": "backend",
      "port": 4010,
      "envPrefix": "POS_STRAPI",
      "urlVar": "NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL",
      "domains": [],
      "npmWorkspace": false,
      "launcher": false,
      "descriptorScan": false,
      "note": "Legacy Strapi backend. Retires in ERP 2.0 phase P2; every frontend reaches it via NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL, not a per-app URL var."
    },
    {
      "key": "core",
      "unit": "rutba_core",
      "workspace": "services/core",
      "npm": "@rutba/core",
      "kind": "backend",
      "port": 4020,
      "envPrefix": "CORE",
      "urlVar": "NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL",
      "domains": [],
      "npmWorkspace": false,
      "build": false,
      "launcher": false,
      "descriptorScan": false,
      "note": "Koa/Knex backend serving the same descriptor contract. Plain Node — no bundling step, hence build:false. Shares NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL with strapi because RUTBA_BACKEND picks which one listens."
    },
    {"key":"storefront","unit":"rutba_storefront","workspace":"apps/content/storefront","npm":"@rutba/storefront","kind":"app","port":4000,"category":"content","envPrefix":"STOREFRONT","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_STOREFRONT_URL","domains":["storefront"],"public":true,"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"stock","unit":"rutba_stock","workspace":"apps/inventory/stock","npm":"@rutba/stock","kind":"app","port":4001,"category":"inventory","envPrefix":"STOCK","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_STOCK_URL","domains":["stock"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"pos","unit":"rutba_pos","workspace":"apps/sales/pos","npm":"@rutba/pos","kind":"app","port":4002,"category":"sales","envPrefix":"POS","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_POS_URL","domains":["pos"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"auth","unit":"rutba_auth","workspace":"apps/admin/auth","npm":"@rutba/auth","kind":"app","port":4003,"category":"admin","envPrefix":"AUTH","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_URL","domains":["auth"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"portal","unit":"rutba_portal","workspace":"apps/sales/portal","npm":"@rutba/portal","kind":"app","port":4004,"category":"sales","envPrefix":"PORTAL","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_PORTAL_URL","domains":["portal"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"crm","unit":"rutba_crm","workspace":"apps/sales/crm","npm":"@rutba/crm","kind":"app","port":4005,"category":"sales","envPrefix":"CRM","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_CRM_URL","domains":["crm"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"hr","unit":"rutba_hr","workspace":"apps/people/hr","npm":"@rutba/hr","kind":"app","port":4006,"category":"people","envPrefix":"HR","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_HR_URL","domains":["hr"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"accounts","unit":"rutba_accounts","workspace":"apps/finance/accounts","npm":"@rutba/accounts","kind":"app","port":4007,"category":"finance","envPrefix":"ACCOUNTS","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_ACCOUNTS_URL","domains":["accounts","accounts-ap","accounts-ar","accounts-viewer"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"payroll","unit":"rutba_payroll","workspace":"apps/finance/payroll","npm":"@rutba/payroll","kind":"app","port":4008,"category":"finance","envPrefix":"PAYROLL","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_PAYROLL_URL","domains":["payroll"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"cms","unit":"rutba_cms","workspace":"apps/content/cms","npm":"@rutba/cms","kind":"app","port":4009,"category":"content","envPrefix":"CMS","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_CMS_URL","domains":["cms"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"social","unit":"rutba_social","workspace":"apps/content/social","npm":"@rutba/social","kind":"app","port":4011,"category":"content","envPrefix":"SOCIAL","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_SOCIAL_URL","domains":["social"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"rider","unit":"rutba_rider","workspace":"apps/sales/rider","npm":"@rutba/rider","kind":"app","port":4012,"category":"sales","envPrefix":"RIDER","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_RIDER_URL","domains":["rider"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"orders","unit":"rutba_orders","workspace":"apps/sales/orders","npm":"@rutba/orders","kind":"app","port":4013,"category":"sales","envPrefix":"ORDERS","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_ORDERS_URL","domains":["orders"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"manufacturing","unit":"rutba_manufacturing","workspace":"apps/inventory/manufacturing","npm":"@rutba/manufacturing","kind":"app","port":4014,"category":"inventory","envPrefix":"MANUFACTURING","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_MANUFACTURING_URL","domains":["manufacturing"],"descriptorScan":true},
    {"key":"ess","unit":"rutba_ess","workspace":"apps/people/ess","npm":"@rutba/ess","kind":"app","port":4015,"category":"people","envPrefix":"ESS","urlVar":"NEXT_PUBLIC_ESS_URL","domains":["ess"],"descriptorScan":true},
